WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
Well, partners, that trail led to the wrong door.

2
00:00:03.905 --> 00:00:06.240
The real culprit is on the screen now.

3
00:00:06.705 --> 00:00:08.640
Compare the votes with the evidence,

4
00:00:08.785 --> 00:00:11.120
and see where the room took a wrong turn.

5
00:00:11.585 --> 00:00:12.720
No hard feelings.

6
00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:15.520
Even a good detective gets dust in their eyes.
